comments.body:
This quest is useless as an XP gain.. because there is none.&nbsp; You get a little biut of silver and maybe an item.&nbsp; 

However, it is a repeatable quest for Stormwind rep.&nbsp; But it only gives 25 rep per go.

I would tend to say that pre-level 40 it isn't worth it particularly since you have to do a LOT of running back and forth to get the supplies, not to mention all of the killing you have to do of Lost Ones to get to the boxes.&nbsp; However, as a farming quest at 40+ or as a level 60 trying to gain more rep... it could be worth it...
